# Nexus - Particle Physics Simulator

## Overview
A real-time 3D particle physics simulator with 5 interactive modes:
- 💥 Explode - Click to burst particles outward
- 🌀 Swirl - Drag to create galaxy-like swirls
- ⚫ Black Hole - Hold to suck particles in
- 🌍 Gravity - Click for gravitational pull
- 🔥 Fire - Click to create rising flames

## Tech Stack
- React 18 + TypeScript
- Three.js for 3D rendering
- @react-three/fiber for React integration
- @react-three/drei for helpers
- @react-three/postprocessing for bloom effect

## Architecture
- Single file: `src/App.tsx` contains all logic
- 10,000+ particles running at 60fps
- GPU-accelerated using Three.js Points
- Post-processing bloom for glow effect

## Key Features
- Real-time particle physics
- Mouse interaction with 5 modes
- FPS counter
- Particle count control
- Speed and size controls
- Orbit controls for camera

